{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:tangent-space-horizontal-vertical-splitting","title":"lem:tangent-space-horizontal-vertical-splitting","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":641,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#lem:tangent-space-horizontal-vertical-splitting","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:vertical-space]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:horizontal-space]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:horizontal-lift-tangent]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:horizontal-lift-linear-spec]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"lem:tangent-space-horizontal-vertical-splitting","line":1034,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[The tangent space splits]\n\\label{lem:tangent-space-horizontal-vertical-splitting}\n\n\\uses{def:vertical-space, def:horizontal-space, def:horizontal-lift-tangent}\n\n\n\n\nFor every $x$, $T_x\\tilde M=H_x\\oplus V_x$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:vertical-space,def:horizontal-space,def:horizontal-lift-tangent,lem:horizontal-lift-linear-spec}\n\\sketch A vector in $H_x\\cap V_x$ has zero $\\tilde g_x$-norm, hence is zero. For $v\\in T_x\\tilde M$, set $v^H=L_x(d\\pi_xv)$ and $v^V=v-v^H$; Lemma \\ref{lem:horizontal-lift-linear-spec} gives $v^H\\in H_x$ and $v^V\\in V_x$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[The tangent space splits] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a74616e67656e742d73706163652d686f72697a6f6e74616c2d766572746963616c2d73706c697474696e67\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Avertical-space\">↗ def:vertical-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ahorizontal-space\">↗ def:horizontal-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ahorizontal-lift-tangent\">↗ def:horizontal-lift-tangent</a> <p></p>For every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x$\">$x$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_x\\tilde M=H_x\\oplus V_x$\">$T_x\\tilde M=H_x\\oplus V_x$</span>.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Avertical-space\">↗ def:vertical-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ahorizontal-space\">↗ def:horizontal-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ahorizontal-lift-tangent\">↗ def:horizontal-lift-tangent</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahorizontal-lift-linear-spec\">↗ lem:horizontal-lift-linear-spec</a> \\sketch A vector in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$H_x\\cap V_x$\">$H_x\\cap V_x$</span> has zero <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\tilde g_x$\">$\\tilde g_x$</span>-norm, hence is zero. For <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v\\in T_x\\tilde M$\">$v\\in T_x\\tilde M$</span>, set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v^H=L_x(d\\pi _xv)$\">$v^H=L_x(d\\pi _xv)$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v^V=v-v^H$\">$v^V=v-v^H$</span>; Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahorizontal-lift-linear-spec\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:horizontal-lift-linear-spec\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a686f72697a6f6e74616c2d6c6966742d6c696e6561722d73706563\">7</a> gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v^H\\in H_x$\">$v^H\\in H_x$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v^V\\in V_x$\">$v^V\\in V_x$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:horizontal-lift-tangent","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:horizontal-lift-of-vector-field","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:vertical-space","title":"def:vertical-space","label":"def:vertical-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:horizontal-space","title":"def:horizontal-space","label":"def:horizontal-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:horizontal-lift-tangent","title":"def:horizontal-lift-tangent","label":"def:horizontal-lift-tangent"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:horizontal-lift-linear-spec","title":"lem:horizontal-lift-linear-spec","label":"lem:horizontal-lift-linear-spec"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:horizontal-vector-field-properties","title":"prop:horizontal-vector-field-properties","label":"prop:horizontal-vector-field-properties"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:tangent-space-horizontal-vertical-splitting","title":"lem:tangent-space-horizont